; ARCH structure — three pieces forming a stone gateway overhead.
; The arch SPAN is the dark horizontal band visually above the path
; (it isn't really "above" — Godot is 2D top-down — but in the
; landmark-language it reads as "stone arch overhead"). The two ARCH
; SUPPORTS descend from the span to the pillars, completing the
; gateway silhouette.
